gate: closeout.verify
skip_when: the branch scope matches no plan document
budget: 2
taxonomy: Completion Signals, Functional Scope & Behavior
produces: none
next: closeout.merge

gate: closeout.merge
skip_when: no scoped document's claims diverge from the branch result
budget: 1 question per document awaiting an update
taxonomy: Terminology & Consistency, Misc / Placeholders
produces: none
next: closeout.accept

gate: closeout.accept
skip_when: no scoped document carries status: draft
budget: 1 question per draft document in scope
taxonomy: Completion Signals
produces: none
next: closeout.capture

gate: closeout.capture
skip_when: the branch scope matches no plan document, or the plan tasks, the verify report, and the merge report name no residue beyond the delivered work itself
budget: 1 question per named residue
taxonomy: Completion Signals, Constraints & Tradeoffs
produces: task-type or guide per the actor boundary rule in skills/_shared/tracks/experience.md; for a settled standard or choice, whatever skills/_shared/tracks/decision.md (entry decision.classify) produces, restricted to its standard cascade draft
next: closeout.discharge

gate: closeout.discharge
skip_when: the branch scope matches no plan document; or a plan task or acceptance criterion carries a verdict other than fulfilled; or the plan file appears in the uncommitted-changes block of skills/_shared/branch-state.md. The gate names the unmet condition in the report and exits
budget: 1
taxonomy: Completion Signals
produces: none
next: end

